/// audio and video media into a stream. Only video producing devices can
/// join the session and record media. Both audio and video tracks are
/// currently required for WebRTC ingestion. Current requirements: Video
/// track: H.264 Audio track: Opus The resulting ingested video in the
/// Kinesis video stream will have the following parameters: H.264 video and
